    <decisions>
        <name>Loaner_Is_Null_Check</name>
        <label>Loaner Is Null Check</label>
        <locationX>374</locationX>
        <locationY>276</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Default Outcome</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Is_Not_Null</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Loaner__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_All_Product_Items_of_Loaner</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Is Not Null</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Skip_If_Duplicate</name>
        <label>Skip If Duplicate</label>
        <locationX>374</locationX>
        <locationY>520</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Build_Location_String</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Not Duplicate</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Is_Duplicate</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Is_Location_In_String</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Loop_Through_Locations</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Is Duplicate</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>05/27/26 (GD) – Replaces DLRS Loaner_Location rule. Adds distinct ProductItem__c.Location__c onto Loaner__c.Loaner_Location__c when a ProductItem is updated. Loaner_Is_Null_Check decision prevents SOQL when Loaner__c is blank. Note: if Loaner__c is reparented, the old parent is not recalculated — $Record__Prior is unavailable in async paths.
06/01/26 (GD) – Added Loaner__c IsNull false to entry criteria to prevent async scheduling when Location__c changes on a ProductItem with no Loaner.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Is_Location_In_String</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>CONTAINS(&quot;,&quot; &amp; {!Concatenated_Location} &amp; &quot;,&quot;, &quot;,&quot; &amp; TEXT({!Loop_Through_Locations.Location__c}) &amp; &quot;,&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>Trimmed_Location</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(RIGHT({!Concatenated_Location}, 1) = &quot;,&quot;, LEFT({!Concatenated_Location}, LEN({!Concatenated_Location}) - 1), {!Concatenated_Location})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>ProductItem | Asynchronous, on update, Loaner Location Roll Up {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>ProductItem | Asynchronous, on update, Loaner Location Roll Up</label>
